### What happened?

When running a very simple example (see below), the process most of the time (not always) exits with exit code -1073740940 (0xC0000374). The error seems to be caused by a combination of connection.query and db.close.

Using an in-memory db or on-disk does not matter. When not executing a query, the script finishes without errors. When not calling `db.close()` it also finishes without errors even when running a query.


