### What happened?

It seems like if you use multiple versions of the kuzu rust crate they all share the same storage backend, even if individually they have different storage backend versions. I would expect that each kuzu crate has it's own storage backend version, even if multiple versions are present in the same project.

My reasoning for wanting this is I'd like to be able to auto-upgrade a DB. So I need a kuzu with the older storage backend to load in & export it, and then with the newer version I can import it

