Builtins: "bun:main" "node:assert" "node:constants" "node:path" "node:process"
Elapsed: 1282ms | User: 197ms | Sys: 328ms
RSS: 0.54GB | Peak: 0.56GB | Commit: 1.07GB | Faults: 52

panic(main thread): Segmentation fault at address 0xDC701D4100E8
oh no: Bun has crashed. This indicates a bug in Bun, not your code.

